[en.FOCUS_C04_ANOTHER_NOTICE]
Another Waste Paper

[en.FOCUS_C04_ANOTHER_NOTICE_desc]
The Empire has sent another conscription notice, but this time it is not the usual impassioned slogan, threat, or curse, but a reward notice.\nSpitfire is on the verge of worrying about the expansion costs of Stratusburg, as the first year of the restaurant expansion will have almost no income to cover the expansion costs. Coincidentally, the Empire now proposes that each conscripted soldier can earn a substantial bonus for Stratusburg, with each soldier’s bonus being comparable to a fine Crystal from Timbucktu...

[zh.FOCUS_C04_ANOTHER_NOTICE]
又一份废纸

[zh.FOCUS_C04_ANOTHER_NOTICE_desc]
帝国再次发来了征兵通知，不过这次不再是像以前一样的激昂口号、威胁亦或者咒骂，此次反而是一份奖励通知。\n由于云中城那边以闪电天马学院支付了马芬的费用，餐馆扩建的第一年将几乎没有收入可以填平扩建支出，因此，喷火正在为层云馆的扩建费用发愁。恰好，如今帝国则提出每一名被征召的士兵都可以让层云堡获得一笔不小的奖金，每名士兵的奖金都堪比一枚上好的廷马克图水晶...

